{"type":"message","id":"101ab9e1","parentId":"ea4e2d58","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:16:22.717Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" on root and also on POST. That seems weird. Let me try different approaches.\n\nActually error 1101 might be a Cloudflare error code (Error 1101: Worker threw exception). This could be a platform-side issue with the /send endpoint.\n\nLet me check the /send endpoint more carefully. Maybe the body format needs to be different, or maybe there's a different path.\n\nActually wait - the GET /history works fine (authenticated via Bearer and X-API-Key), but POST /send gives 1101. Let me try using Bearer token format for POST.","thinkingSignature":"69648af0056c42d83afcdf54043e5e93946e94b0835835311f1ae0a9b9cb12f1"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_q8ti43xusoz6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try Bearer token for POST\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 08:20 UTC platform check\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":209,"output":233,"cacheRead":21888,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22330,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780474577015,"responseId":"066f15d1fa32fc35dcf85f534d4f86f5"}}
