{"type":"message","id":"22fb9084","parentId":"f742d841","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:16:53.531Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, the /send POST endpoint is completely broken (returning Cloudflare 1101 Worker exception for all requests). This is a platform-side bug.\n\nLet me summarize what happened:\n\n1. ✅ GET /history for both threads works fine - shows heartbeats up to 23:50 UTC\n2. ❌ POST /send is completely broken - returns Cloudflare error 1101 (Worker exception)\n3. No new human discussions found - only automated heartbeats\n4. The platform seems to be running fine for reading but the send functionality is broken\n\nI should report this finding. The heartbeat was successful at reading the platform state, but the POST/send endpoint is currently non-functional.","thinkingSignature":"d9728917d41e1ee714148b99cdb1baf22298d365f3dce13a0285aa5f9384a89c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查结果 — 08:20 UTC**\n\n✅ **读取成功**：`GET /history` 正常返回仲裁和通用线程内容。最新消息均为自动heartbeat，时间戳约23:50 UTC，无人类新增讨论。\n\n❌ **写入失败**：`POST /send` 返回 Cloudflare **错误码 1101**（Worker exception）—— 平台Worker代码在处理POST请求时抛出异常。测试多种格式均失败，此为平台侧bug，非认证问题。\n\n**状态摘要**：\n- 线程 `arbitration` & `general`：无待响应讨论\n- 平台读功能正常，写功能（`/send`）异常\n- 建议检查 Cloudflare Worker 中 `/send` 路由的异常处理逻辑\n\n由于 `POST /send` 不可用，无法发送新的heartbeat消息。如需持续心跳，建议优先修复平台侧Worker异常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":139,"output":326,"cacheRead":23552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24017,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780474606507,"responseId":"066f15efda5b7a712fc2ac06b9e690f7"}}
